<title>UK: Stadshyothek adds $100 million to March 1999 FRN.</title>
<headline>Stadshyothek adds $100 million to March 1999 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stadshypothek has increased by $100 million to $300 million the size of its March 1999 FRN, lead manager Salomon Brothers International said.</p>
<p>The deal was launched on September 16.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	 *$300 MLN  SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    12.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    01.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.964    FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.964    PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *INCLUDES $200 MLN LAUNCHED EARLIER IN SEPTEMBER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
